    <h3>LAYAWAY</h3>

    <p>Our layaway plan is 1⁄3 down followed by a payment of 1⁄3 the next month with a final 1⁄3 payment in 60 days. If
        you need additional time for a large purchase please let us know, we will try to accommodate you.</p>

    <hr>

    <h3>SHIPPING</h3>

    <p>For Jewelry purchases, shipping and insurance for packages sent to addresses inside the United States is gratis.
        We ship Federal Express overnight or second day, insured, Adult Signature Required. For shipping overseas, ask
        for a quote, it must be insured and generally is via FedEx, Postal service or DHL.</p>
    <p>Objets, Art and Furniture will be shipped on a case by case basis please request a quote. Smaller items may also
        be gratis, please check the listing. The cost of shipping outside the United States is <b>not</b> included in the
        price.</p>
    <p>If you wish to specify NEXT DAY or Overnight Express Service, we would be happy to accommodate you, there may be
        an upcharge. If you are purchasing by credit card, we are required by the credit card company to ship to only
        the BILLING ADDRESS of the credit card.</p>

    <hr>

