    <h3>
        RETURN POLICY: ONLINE PURCHASES
    </h3>


    <p><b>Any piece purchased online</b> can be returned for a period of seven days (from date of delivery). The piece must be
        returned in original condition. Items that have been modified or worked on by your jewelers are not
        returnable.</p>
    <p>Returns after the grace period of seven days may be allowed solely at our discretion and may be assessed a 15%
        restocking fee. If you have had us modify or customize an item, or you have modified an item, it is not
        returnable. Rings that are sized by us are the exception to this rule.</p>

    <hr>

    <h3>RETURN POLICY: GALLERY AND SHOWS</h3>
    <p>Purchase may be exchanged for a period of 30 days from the date of purchase. After 30 days all sales are
        final.</p>

